+ * SPDX-License-Identifier: ISC
+ *
+ * Standalone test binary for OneWifi HAL DML decode / radio-cap / encode.
+ *
+ * Fetches real DML JSON from Device.WiFi.WebConfig.Data.Init_dml via the
+ * rbus/CCSP bus.  Pass a JSON file path as argument to use a captured dump
+ * instead of the live bus.
+ *
+ * Tests exercised:
+ *   1. webconfig_proto_easymesh_init + webconfig_init (init)
+ *   2. decode DML JSON → verify em_radio_cap_info_t is populated (radio caps)
+ *
+ * Build:
+ *   cmake ... -DBUILD_ONEWIFI_HAL_TEST=ON   (or -DBUILD_TESTS=ON)
+ *   Binary installed to <install_dir>/tests/dml_test
+ *
+ * Run on-device:
+ *   dml_test                    – fetches from live bus (OneWifi must be running)
+ *   dml_test /path/to/dml.json  – uses a captured DML JSON file directly
+ */
+
